---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
const d='/equipment/13-11/',brochure='https://downloads.leica-microsystems.com/EM%20CPD300/Brochure%20or%20Flyer/Leica%20EM%20CPD300%20Brochure%20V2016-02%20Screen.pdf#page=2',outline='https://cam.msu.edu/_assets/documents/manuals/EM_CPD300_instruction_manual.pdf#page=11';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Leica EM CPD300 dormant reference and offline geometry" description="Orbit an inactive Leica EM CPD300 reference and compare dimensionless cube ratios on a separate stand." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment" id="cpd300"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/13-11/">← Equipment 13-11</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Register</a><a href="#cpd-evidence">References and checks</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><p class="eq-meta">13-11 / DOCUMENTARY EXTERIOR · SEPARATE MATH DIAGRAM</p><h2>Inspect the cabinet and compare cubes</h2><p class="eq-lede">The Leica EM CPD300 is a static, de-energized reference. The detached gold and teal cubes illustrate geometric scaling only.</p></header>
<div class="cp-cols"><section><h3>Unpowered exterior</h3><canvas id="cpd-model" aria-label="Orbitable Leica EM CPD300 and detached math cubes"></canvas><p id="cpd-viewstatus" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><button id="cpd-front">Reset overview</button><button id="cpd-rear">Rear outline</button><button id="cpd-board">Detached cubes</button></section>
<section><h3>Independent cube ratios</h3><label>Gold cube edge ratio <select id="cpd-ratio"><option value="0.5">Half · 0.5</option><option value="1">Equal · 1</option><option value="1.5">Larger · 1.5</option></select></label><button id="cpd-next">Next diagram ratio</button>
<table><thead><tr><th>Edge s</th><th>Area s²</th><th>Volume s³</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td id="cpd-edge"></td><td id="cpd-area"></td><td id="cpd-volume"></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>The teal cube is the unit reference. The gold cube changes by the selected dimensionless factor; this has no relationship to any material, chamber or device.</p><button id="cpd-export">Download abstract result</button><p><a href={d+'example-geometry.json'}>Example ratios at s = 0.5</a>.</p></section></div>
<section id="cpd-evidence"><h3>Documented exterior</h3>
<div class="cp-cols"><figure><img src={d+'station.webp'} alt="Original angled exterior render of CPD300 and separate cube diagram"/><figcaption>The <a href={brochure}>Leica brochure V2016‑02, p. 2</a> shows the white sloped housing, blanked display surround and upper cap silhouette. Original 3D reconstruction, not copied vendor photo.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src={d+'rear.webp'} alt="Original rear cabinet view, with no operating connectors"/><figcaption>Rear exterior reconstruction. <a href={outline}>Leica drawing, manual 06/12 p. 11</a> anchors the overall dimensions. Rear feature sizes and layout are inferred; all exterior parts are static, and live fittings are not modeled.</figcaption></figure></div>
<table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Exterior W × H × D</td><td>340 × 332.5 × 583.5 mm</td><td>Within 1.0 mm per axis in exported GLB</td></tr><tr><td>Unit-neutral</td><td>1, 1, 1 ratios</td><td>Exact</td></tr><tr><td>Half edge</td><td>0.5, 0.25, 0.125 ratios</td><td>Exact</td></tr><tr><td>One and a half edge</td><td>1.5, 2.25, 3.375 ratios</td><td>Exact</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>The standalone diagram covers only the mathematical portion of the proposed test. No preparation, chamber operation, process parameters, material effects, sample states or lineage are implemented.</p>
<p><a href={d+'build-model.py'}>Editable Blender source</a> · <a href={d+'cpd300.glb'}>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={d+'geometry-card.mjs'}>Geometry module and report</a> · <a href={d+'vr.json'}>VR action bounds</a>. Headset use not verified.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/13-11/client.mjs';</script>
<style is:global>
#cpd300 .cp-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}#cpd300 section{margin:1rem 0;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);min-width:0}
#cpd300 :is(button,select){font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.4rem;margin:.2rem .25rem .2rem 0;max-width:100%}#cpd300 button{cursor:pointer}#cpd300 :is(button,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid #b28d5e}
#cpd-model{width:100%;height:354px;display:block;touch-action:none}#cpd300 figure{margin:.5rem 0}#cpd300 figure img{width:100%}
#cpd300 table{width:100%;font-size:.94rem;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left}#cpd300 td,#cpd300 th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:.35rem}
@media(max-width:850px){#cpd300 .cp-cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}#cpd-model{height:282px}}
</style>
